{{ JSON.stringify($json.material, null, 1) }}

Write at most 200 words. Lead with the single most consequential change and say plainly whether it is a new risk, a dropped one or a rewrite. Then group the rest into two or three themes and name them. A rewrite that only adds hedging language is worth saying so about rather than dressing up. If the changes are all boilerplate, say that - a quiet year is a finding. No preamble, no bullet points, no sign-off.

